                    </div>
                    <div class="terminal-logs">
                        <div><span class="log-accent">✓</span> Skibidi toilet check: <span style="color:#FFF;">Blocked</span></div>
                        <div><span class="log-accent">✓</span> Rizz level: <span class="log-warn">Unstoppable</span></div>
